{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Stop the Government raising Veterans' reserve commitment to 65",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "Veterans signed a contract with the Monarch and Government to serve this country with their reserve commitment extending until they are 55. The Government must abandon what we firmly believe is a breach of contract made by extending the reserve commitment to 65.",
